
===========================
ERBE SW Anisotropic Factors
===========================

Rows correspond to different viewing zenith angle ranges (0-15, 15-27, etc.).
Columns correspond to different relative azimuth angle ranges (0-9, 9-30, etc.).

Reference: Suttles, J. T., R. N. Green, P. Minnis, G. L. Smith, W. F. Staylor, B. A. Wielicki, I. J. Walker, 
           D. F. Young, V. R. Taylor, and L. L. Stowe, 1988: Angular radiation models for Earth-atmosphere 
           system. Volume 1: Shortwave radiation, NASA-RP-1184, 148pp, [online] Available: 
           https://hdl.handle.net/2060/19880018293.
	   
	   
